---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
export function getStaticPaths() {
  const pages = [
    [
      'how-it-works',
      'How it works',
      [
        [
          'Choose categories',
          'Show normally is neutral. Hide collapses matching posts. Always show overrides Hide when categories overlap.',
        ],
        [
          'Understand results',
          'After consent, the intended extension sends rendered post text to your selected provider. Deterministic rules apply your preferences. Incomplete, uncertain and unsupported-language results remain visible. English is the initial evaluation target.',
        ],
        [
          'Stay in control',
          'Reveal affects one post for the page session; it does not retrain a model. Pause restores content. The demo uses predetermined labels, not live model predictions.',
        ],
      ],
    ],
    [
      'install',
      'Installation status',
      [
        [
          'Chrome: unavailable',
          'No approved store listing is configured. This is a development preview.',
        ],
        [
          'Firefox: unavailable',
          'No approved add-on listing is configured. Packaged browser and credential validation are pending.',
        ],
        [
          'Distribution decision pending',
          'LinkedIn restricts extensions that modify its appearance. A product-owner platform assessment is required before distribution. Store approval would not establish platform permission or account safety.',
        ],
      ],
    ],
    [
      'setup',
      'Provider setup',
      [
        [
          'Bring your own key',
          'Configure credentials only in an extension-owned options page. This website never requests a key.',
        ],
        [
          'Provider choices',
          'TypeSafe Jev, OpenAI and Anthropic adapters are in development. No browser/model combination is advertised as validated here, and no fallback provider is chosen silently.',
        ],
        [
          'Intended setup flow',
          'Choose an available provider and model, review recipient and retention information, grant its host permission, enter a session credential, run a synthetic connection test, set category rules and request limits, then explicitly consent and enable. Permission alone is not consent.',
        ],
        [
          'Costs and limits',
          'Usage may incur charges on your provider account. Request and estimated-cost limits are safeguards, not billing guarantees; failed and in-flight requests may be billed. Check your account for actual charges.',
        ],
        [
          'Change or disconnect',
          'Changing the recipient requires fresh consent. Disconnect removes its local credential. Clear all data disables filtering and removes local configuration, consent, cache and diagnostics.',
        ],
      ],
    ],
    [
      'privacy',
      'Privacy notice: development draft',
      [
        [
          'Operator and hosting pending',
          'Legal operator, support contact, domain, hosting vendor and access-log retention are unresolved launch blockers. This is not a completed production privacy review.',
        ],
        [
          'Website and demo',
          'Fixed synthetic examples run locally. The demo collects no keys and sends no provider requests. No analytics or tracking SDK is included. A future host may process access logs; actual practices must be disclosed before launch.',
        ],
        [
          'Extension recipients',
          'After explicit consent, the selected TypeSafe Jev, OpenAI or Anthropic service receives minimized rendered post text and classification instructions. Text may identify people; this is not anonymization or on-device inference. Website maintainers receive no feed content or keys in the baseline design.',
        ],
        [
          'Local data and credentials',
          'Session-only credential custody is proposed, pending browser/provider validation; it is not an OS keychain or secure vault. Preferences, consent, bounded cache and sanitized diagnostics are local. Exact retention and deletion behavior require release verification.',
        ],
        [
          'Withdrawal and deletion',
          'Pause or withdraw consent to stop new transmissions and restore content. Clear all data removes local configuration, consent, cache, keys and diagnostics. It cannot retract transmitted requests or delete provider-held records. Retention and training depend on the service and account terms; zero retention is not promised.',
        ],
        [
          'Excluded surfaces',
          'The intended scope is rendered desktop home-feed text. Messages, profiles, notifications, search and the Jobs application are excluded. No LinkedIn cookies or login credentials are requested.',
        ],
      ],
    ],
    [
      'support',
      'FAQ and support',
      [
        [
          'Can classification be wrong?',
          'Yes. Categories overlap and model results may be uncertain or incorrect. Always show protects matching categories. Demo labels are not an accuracy measurement.',
        ],
        [
          'Does this block every advertisement?',
          'No. Sponsored content requires a reliable visible disclosure; organic launches are not automatically advertisements.',
        ],
        [
          'Why no install button?',
          'Public listings, supported configurations and release approvals are pending.',
        ],
        [
          'How do I get help?',
          'Public support contact is pending and blocks launch. Use your existing project contact until one is assigned. Never share keys, private feed screenshots, post text or raw responses.',
        ],
        [
          'What belongs in a report?',
          'Build version, browser family, sanitized error code, synthetic reproduction steps and expected behavior. Review diagnostic exports before sharing.',
        ],
      ],
    ],
    [
      'changelog',
      'Changelog',
      [
        [
          '0.1.0 development candidate',
          'Static preview website and synthetic policy demo with category controls and per-post reveal. Runtime and provider work remain subject to integration and browser evaluation.',
        ],
        [
          'Known limitations',
          'No public install links, validated live quality claims or release approval. Independent annotation, browser accessibility checks and operator facts remain pending.',
        ],
      ],
    ],
    [
      '404',
      'Page not found',
      [
        [
          'Find your way back',
          'Use the navigation to return home or try the synthetic demo.',
        ],
      ],
    ],
  ] as const;
  return pages.map(([slug, title, sections]) => ({
    params: { slug },
    props: { title, sections },
  }));
}
const { title, sections } = Astro.props;
---

<Site
  title={title}
  description={`${title} for the ClearedIn development preview.`}
>
  <h1>{title}</h1>
  {sections.map(([heading, text]) => (
    <section>
      <h2>{heading}</h2>
      <p>{text}</p>
    </section>
  ))}
</Site>
